{"root":{"data":{"id":"dmh0avm2eko0","created":1793245007350,"text":"神经网络"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh0bbf5qlc0","created":1793245041761,"text":"神经元模型"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh0dkg19pc0","created":1793245218133,"text":"M-P神经元模型"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh0e68csmo0","created":1793245265558,"text":"人工神经网络最基础单元。接收多个输入，每个输入带连接权重，将加权求和结果减去阈值，送入激活函数得到输出。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmh0dnw2ag80","created":1793245225633,"text":"两类激活函数"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh0dwus9yw0","created":1793245245146,"text":"阶跃函数"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh0egf8xzc0","created":1793245287743,"text":"输出 0/1，代表抑制 / 兴奋；缺点：不连续、不可导，无法用于梯度优化。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmh0e1eg7og0","created":1793245255043,"text":"Sigmoid函数"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh0ekcd8rs0","created":1793245296276,"text":"把实数映射到(0,1)，连续光滑可导，也叫挤压函数。"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmh0ds0j97k0","created":1793245234610,"text":"神经网络"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh0enf2x4w0","created":1793245302970,"text":"大量神经元按照一定层次互连组成，本质是带大量参数的复合数学函数。"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmh0bf4dkcg0","created":1793245049816,"text":"感知机与多层网络"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh0esv2vq80","created":1793245314821,"text":"感知机"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh0ewuvtv40","created":1793245323517,"text":"两层神经元（输入层+输出层M-P神经元），只有输出层是功能神经元。 可以实现线性可分的逻辑运算：与、或、非。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmh0f5uva400","created":1793245343107,"text":"局限"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh0fdvtlrc0","created":1793245360579,"text":"只能处理线性可分问题，无法解决异或（XOR）这类非线性可分问题；线性不可分数据集上训练会震荡，无法收敛。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmh0fj66qrk0","created":1793245372089,"text":"多层前馈神经网络"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh0ftpk6u00","created":1793245395029,"text":"增加隐含层（隐层），隐层、输出层都是带激活函数的功能神经元，输入层只做信号接收，不做计算。只要含有至少一个隐层，就是多层网络。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmh0fprhxew0","created":1793245386438,"text":"结构特点"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh0fy661ts0","created":1793245404740,"text":"层间全连接，无同层连接、无跨层连接、无环路。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmh0g3cfdko0","created":1793245416002,"text":"单隐层网络"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh0g6gry8w0","created":1793245422795,"text":"输入层 + 1个隐层 + 输出层，可以拟合任意复杂连续函数。"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmh0bja8fjs0","created":1793245058877,"text":" 误差逆传播算法（BP算法）"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh0gl3j72w0","created":1793245454646,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmh0gl4aso00","created":1793245454693,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmh0dawbxuw0","created":1793245197351,"text":"全局最小与局部极小"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmh0ddvnt2g0","created":1793245203840,"text":"其他常见神经网络"},"children":[]}]},"template":"default","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}